    "body": "@davidkna that does work (I came here wondering about the same thing). Thank you.\r\n\r\nThe risk here is that someone will upgrade the `git_status` module, and add something to `all_status` that we will be missing out on.\r\n\r\nI suppose the general question/feature request is \"How do I cause a format string to be treated as None for the purposes of conditional format strings (https://starship.rs/config/#conditional-format-strings) so that I can disable a specific feature without opting out of features that are added in the future?\". If there is already a feature request for that general feature then I guess this can be marked as a duplicate of that?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
